# Recorded input for the tabs example page (widgets/tabs.zig, `Page`), at 320 x 200 in the
# default theme: tabs General at 8..83, View at 83..132, About at 132..190, all at y 8..38;
# the panels below from y 38. Keys are USB HID codes: 79 Right, 80 Left, 74 Home, 77 End
# (format: input.Replay).
# 0: rest, General selected
frame
viewport 320 200
dt 0.016
pointer 300 190
# 1: hover View
frame
pointer 107 23
# 2: press it: it takes focus
frame
buttons left
# 3: release over it: View selected
frame
buttons
# 4: Right: focus and selection move to About
frame
press 79
# 5: Home: to General
frame
press 74
# 6: End: to About
frame
press 77
# 7: Left: to View
frame
press 80
